# PLACEHOLDER — the Hydro Tray, a deep-water-culture reservoir. GENERATED by a script: edit the
# script's matrices (kept in the session notes / crops.md), not the PNGs.
#
# From how real DWC systems are built: an OPAQUE dark reservoir (light in the water means algae), a
# thin lid holding a net pot of expanded clay pebbles the plant grows out of, an air pump above the
# water line feeding an airline, and a sight tube on the outside showing the level. Vanilla grammar:
# a vessel showing its contents at levels (the cauldron), small parts cut from sub-regions of one
# texture (the flower pot), and 1:1 UVs so nothing is stretched.
#
# Second pass (2026-09-16), after looking at it in the game: the pump was a hollow copper frame and
# read as an empty picture frame; the lid's edge borrowed the lid top's border bands and read as a
# heavy bevelled cap; the tube frame was a bright stripe competing with the liquid; the side's hand
# grip read as a black vent; the black airline vanished into the black tote; and the pebbles were a
# speckled tile that read as dirt. Now: a solid grey pump with vents and a copper nozzle, a plain lid
# edge, a thin dark tube frame, a slim handle slot, a light tube, and pebbles drawn as round balls.

@palette default
0 = 17171A      sight-tube channel, deep
1 = 242428      plastic, deepest — sampled from vanilla's cauldron greys
2 = 2D2D32
3 = 343438
4 = 3F3E42      plastic
5 = 494848
6 = 555556
7 = 5E5E60      moulded lip highlight
8 = A9B4BC      airline tube
z = D2DBE0      airline catch-light
9 = 2A2C30      sight-tube frame, dark
k = 9A5038      copper, dark — sampled from vanilla's cut copper
m = C87456      copper
n = E3826C      copper highlight
e = 1F3A1F      indicator, off
f = 2E5A2E
p = 3E241A      gap between pebbles
q = 94542F      pebble shadow — expanded clay is orange-brown, not soil
r = C0703E      pebble
s = E09A62      pebble catch-light
t = 2E4F6B      water, deepest
u = 37607F
v = 43718F      water mid
w = 5285A3
x = 6699B5      water light
y = 86B4CC      water highlight

@palette lid extends=default
0 = 5A5A5A      net pot collar
3 = 6E6E6E
4 = 8F8F8F      lid — sampled from vanilla's smooth stone
5 = 9D9D9D
6 = A3A3A3
7 = B0B0B0

@palette pumpbody extends=default
4 = 7F7F7F      pump housing, light plastic against the dark tote
5 = 8F8F8F
6 = 4A4A4C      vent slit
7 = A8A8A8

@palette led_on extends=default
e = 4CE05A      indicator, lit
f = C8FFC8

@palette solution extends=default
t = 3E4A1E      nutrient solution, deepest
u = 4C5A26
v = 5E6E2F
w = 74853A
x = 8B9C49
y = A3B45B

